All pages (index, about, services, support, inquiry, contact, sitemap)

lang changed to en-ZA. Added a unique title tag, meta description, canonical link and Open Graph tags to every page.
One <h1> per page: the logo text is now a <span class="site-name"> and each page title is the <h1>. Section and card titles use <h2>/<h3> in order. style.css selectors were changed to match.
Added a skip-to-content link, id="main", aria-label on the navigation and aria-current="page" on the active link.
Added the missing Sitemap link to the navigation on index.html. Standardised the footer on all pages and fixed the broken <p> tag in the footers of support.html and sitemap.html.
Images: lowercase file names (e.g. support.jpeg) so they load on case-sensitive hosting, descriptive alt text, width/height on the logo and loading="lazy" on images below the first screen. Added the logo as the browser-tab icon.

JavaScript enhancements (2.1) (js/script.js, plain JavaScript, no jQuery)

services.html: tabbed "Find the Support That Fits You" section with ARIA roles and left/right arrow-key support.
services.html: FAQ accordion with a smooth open/close transition and aria-expanded state.
support.html: each item has a Details button that opens a modal built with createElement. It closes with the X button, a click outside or the Esc key, and focus returns to the button. "Offer this" opens the inquiry form with the item filled in.
about.html: photo gallery with a lightbox (previous/next buttons, arrow keys, Esc, caption with image count). Works with the keyboard.
contact.html: interactive map using Leaflet 1.9.4 and OpenStreetMap, with a marker and popup for the centre.
All pages: scroll-reveal fade-in (CSS transitions + IntersectionObserver), hover transitions on cards, buttons and gallery images. Animations are switched off for visitors who prefer reduced motion.

Dynamic content (2.2)

support.html: the "Items the Centre Needs" list is no longer typed in HTML. It is loaded from data/needs.json with fetch and the cards are built with DOM methods. An error message shows if the file cannot load.
support.html: live search, category filter and sort (name A to Z, Z to A, category), with a "Showing X of Y items" counter.
support.html: the Donate, Volunteer, Partner and Offer Support buttons open inquiry.html?type=..., and the form pre-selects the matching reason.

SEO (3)

Titles, descriptions and headings include local keywords (Mankweng, Polokwane, Limpopo, old age and disability centre, volunteer, donate).
Internal links added between pages (services, support, contact, inquiry, about).
robots.txt and sitemap.xml added to the site root (7 pages).
contact.html: JSON-LD structured data (NGO with address, phone, email) for local SEO.
Mobile-friendly: viewport tag and responsive CSS. Social sharing preview via Open Graph tags.
Page speed: scripts use defer, images lazy-load, cache headers set in _headers.
Security: _headers adds Content-Security-Policy, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy and Permissions-Policy. User text is displayed with textContent, never innerHTML. The inquiry form has a hidden anti-spam field. HTTPS is provided by the host.

Forms (4)

inquiry.html (the enquiry form page): fields for name, email, phone, reason for contact, optional item, quantity and preferred date, message and a consent checkbox. js/forms.js validates every field before sending (letters-only name, email format, South African phone number, quantity range, date not in the past, message 10 to 500 characters with a live counter) and shows an error under each field.
inquiry.html: valid data is submitted with AJAX (fetch POST to Formspree) without reloading the page. The page then shows a response with a reference number and cost or availability information for the chosen reason (donation, volunteering, sponsorship/partnership, services). A failed request shows an error message.
contact.html: contact form with name, email, phone, message type, subject and message. After validation, the details are compiled into an email addressed to kwelanobohloko@gmail.com, with a preview and a button that opens it in the visitor's email app. The form's action is a mailto: fallback.
contact.html: real phone numbers, email and address replaced the placeholder details. The email address is now the same (kwelanobohloko@gmail.com) in the contact card, form, structured data, FAQ and script. Corrected the lowercase "inquiry" label in the navigation.
services.html: FAQ answers updated to match the inquiry form's options.
inquiry.html: replaced the "front-end demonstration" notice with a note that the inquiry is sent through a secure form service.

Other files

css/style.css: heading selectors updated (logo text, hero, page header, cards, notices, contact cards, sitemap items) and a block of new styles added for tabs, accordion, modal, lightbox, gallery, map, forms, search controls and accessibility helpers.
New files: js/script.js, js/forms.js, data/needs.json, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, _headers.

